{
    "title": "Be My Guest - Landlord Sim",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfe0 Build an accommodation empire\r\n\ud83d\udce6 Order new furniture\r\n\ud83e\uddfb Be the perfect host\r\n\ud83d\udc6e\ud83c\udffb Improve your hospitality\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Become a five-star rated landlord\r\n\r\nThe perfect game for aspiring real estate millionaires! Become a wealthy landlord and build your hotel empire from the ground up.\r\n\r\nIn this sim game, you'll start with a small property and a limited budget. Your goal is to strategically invest, buy, and manage properties to grow your rental income and become the most successful landlord in the city. Please be sure to make shrewd decisions, negotiate deals, and maximize your profits to become a tycoon in the competitive real estate market.\r\n\r\nInvest wisely: Choose from a variety of properties, from cozy apartments to luxurious houses, and invest your funds wisely to earn maximum returns.\r\nUpgrade and renovate: Improve your properties' value by adding amenities, upgrading facilities, and renovating interiors to attract high-paying tenants.\r\nStrategic management: Make calculated decisions on prices of rent, negotiate contracts, and handle tenant issues to keep your properties running smoothly.\r\n\r\nExpand your portfolio: Grow your empire by buying new properties in different locations, diversifying your investments, and increasing your rental income.\r\nFinancial planning: Keep an eye on your finances, manage expenses, and balance your budget to ensure long-term success and financial stability.\r\nUnlock achievements: Complete challenging tasks and unlock achievements to earn rewards and boost your reputation as a top-tier landlord.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to take the leap into the world of real estate and prove your skills as a savvy landlord? Download Be My Guest now and start building your property empire today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfe0 Build an accommodation empire<br>\ud83d\udce6 Order new furniture<br>\ud83e\uddfb Be the perfect host<br>\ud83d\udc6e\ud83c\udffb Improve your hospitality<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Become a five-star rated landlord<br><br>The perfect game for aspiring real estate millionaires! Become a wealthy landlord and build your hotel empire from the ground up.<br><br>In this sim game, you&#39;ll start with a small property and a limited budget. Your goal is to strategically invest, buy, and manage properties to grow your rental income and become the most successful landlord in the city. Please be sure to make shrewd decisions, negotiate deals, and maximize your profits to become a tycoon in the competitive real estate market.<br><br>Invest wisely: Choose from a variety of properties, from cozy apartments to luxurious houses, and invest your funds wisely to earn maximum returns.<br>Upgrade and renovate: Improve your properties&#39; value by adding amenities, upgrading facilities, and renovating interiors to attract high-paying tenants.<br>Strategic management: Make calculated decisions on prices of rent, negotiate contracts, and handle tenant issues to keep your properties running smoothly.<br><br>Expand your portfolio: Grow your empire by buying new properties in different locations, diversifying your investments, and increasing your rental income.<br>Financial planning: Keep an eye on your finances, manage expenses, and balance your budget to ensure long-term success and financial stability.<br>Unlock achievements: Complete challenging tasks and unlock achievements to earn rewards and boost your reputation as a top-tier landlord.<br><br>Are you ready to take the leap into the world of real estate and prove your skills as a savvy landlord? Download Be My Guest now and start building your property empire today!",
    "summary": "Buy houses, decorate houses and streets, rent to tenants and make money!",
